{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよ～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ書いてたの間違えて消しちゃって\n心が折れた23時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時にみさ先輩からメールがきて\nずーっとメールをしてて\n気分があがり再びブログに戻ってます(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなメールがきたのか\n秘密にしておきたいけど\n今日はせっかくだから\n特別に載せちゃおうかな(｡-_-｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩のツンデレ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールはこうきたのです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「実は私ドSな一面もあるのですが、大好きなきいちゃんの前だと何故か自然と出ちゃった♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って(｡・・｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもより少しドSなみさ先輩\nかっこよくてセクシーで\nはまりそうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドSなみさ先輩は\n私にしか見せていない！ということなので\n間違ってもみさ先輩に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドSなみさ先輩みしてー！なんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん言っちゃだめすよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドSなみさ先輩は日奈子だけのだから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もしみさ先輩が良いって言ったら\n仕方ないので許してあげまする。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！日奈子にもちゃんと聞いてくださいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(´ｰ∀ｰ`)♪冗談です٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":